<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Reference is made to that
certain At Market Issuance Sales Agreement (the &ldquo;<U>Agreement</U>&rdquo;), dated March&nbsp;[&#9679;], 2026, and entered into between
MultiSensor AI Holdings, Inc., a Delaware Corporation (the &ldquo;<U>Company</U>&rdquo;), Roth Capital Partners, LLC, and H.C. Wainwright
&amp; Co., LLC (collectively, the &ldquo;<U>Agents</U>&rdquo;). This certificate (this &ldquo;<U>Certificate</U>&rdquo;) is being furnished
to the Agent pursuant to <U>Section 7(o)</U> of the Agreement solely to assist the Agents in conducting their due diligence investigation
of the Company in connection with the public offering of the Company&rsquo;s common stock, par value $0.0001 per share, pursuant to the
Agreement, and may be relied upon by the Agents for this purpose. All capitalized terms used but not defined herein shall have the meanings
given to such terms in the Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">In connection with the foregoing,
I, Robert Nadolny, Chief Financial Officer of the Company, do hereby certify on behalf of the Company, and not in my individual capacity,
as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">1.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;I
have reviewed the Registration Statement, including the Prospectus, and all reports, statements, filings, and other documents incorporated
or deemed to be incorporated by reference therein, including, without limitation, the Company&rsquo;s Annual Report on Form 10-K for the
fiscal year ended December 31, 202[&#9679;], filed with the Commission on [&#9679;] and the Company&rsquo;s Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q
for the quarterly periods ended [&#9679;] (filed with the Commission on [&#9679;]), [&#9679;] (filed with the Commission on [&#9679;]),
and [&#9679;] (filed with the Commission on [&#9679;]) (collectively, the &ldquo;<U>Offering Documents</U>&rdquo;), including the circled
information contained or incorporated by reference in the Offering Documents set forth in <U>Annex A</U> attached hereto (the &ldquo;<U>Circled
Information</U>&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">2.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;Either
I, or one or more employees of the Company who are responsible for the Company&rsquo;s financial and accounting matters and report directly
to me and whom I directly supervise, have reviewed and supervised the preparation of the financial statements and other financial data
included in the Offering Documents.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">3.&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;Nothing
has come to my attention that caused me to believe that each item of Circled Information was not accurate in all material respects as
of the date of this Certificate, except for any item of Circled Information that speaks solely as of a specific date, in which case as
of such other date.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><I>[Signature page follows]</I></P>

